This version has been modified:
  - split into separate parts (fuselage sections, wings, control surfaces, engine pods, bay doors) and re-pivoted;
  - rescaled to the real B-52H dimensions and re-oriented for Unity / Nuclear Option;
  - the exterior textures packed into a single 4096 x 4096 texture atlas, with the UVs remapped;
  - the cockpit interior pulled inside the hull where it showed through, and inward-facing skin faces flipped;
  - landing-gear wells cut into the lower fuselage and the outer wings, the cut-out skin reused as the well doors;
  - new parts added that are not in the original: landing gear, gear-well doors, spoiler panels, bomb-bay interior
    and the flight-deck interior.

The original model is provided by its author as-is, without warranties (CC BY 4.0, Section 5).
